===Etymology===
From {{inh|bar|gmh|scharpf}}, from {{inh|bar|goh|scarf}}, from from {{inh|bar|gmw-pro|*skarp}}, from {{inh|bar|gem-pro|*skarpaz}}, from {{der|bar|ine-pro|*(s)kerb-}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*(s)ker-||to cut}}.

===Adjective===
{{head|bar|adjective}}

